# Every file under api/ is built as a Serverless Function, and the Hobby plan
# caps a deployment at 12 of them. Going over does not fail the build — it
# fails afterwards, at "Deploying outputs...", so the build log looks clean
# and CI stays green while production silently keeps serving the last good
# deploy. Test files are not endpoints and must not consume a slot.
#
# vitest still collects these: it runs from the repo, not from the Vercel
# build (see the "api/**/*.test.ts" include in vitest.config.ts).
api/**/*.test.ts
